<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Descarte Messaging Program Privacy Policy</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
</head>
<body style="font:16px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Inter,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:760px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px;color:#111">
  <h1>Descarte Messaging Program Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Descarte offers an SMS-based grocery concierge service. By opting in, you agree to this Policy.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Your mobile phone number, message content you send us, and basic delivery/engagement metadata from our provider.</p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>To respond to your messages, operate the service, prevent abuse, and comply with law.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties/affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong>
     Mobile information will not be sold, rented, or shared for marketing.
     We may share data with service providers (e.g., our messaging carrier/processor) solely to deliver the service.</p>

  <h2>Opt-in/Opt-out/Help</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Opt-in by texting <code>JOIN</code> or any inquiry to +1 (888) 378-9655 (or our active number).</li>
    <li>Reply <code>STOP</code> to cancel; <code>START</code> to rejoin; <code>HELP</code> for help.</li>
    <li>Message frequency varies; Msg&amp;Data rates may apply.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Security &amp; retention</h2>
  <p>We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures. We retain messages and metadata only as needed for the service and legal compliance.</p>

  <h2>Your choices &amp; contact</h2>
  <p>You can opt out at any time via <code>STOP</code>. For privacy requests, contact:
     <a href="mailto:spencer@nocturnalsecurity.com">spencer@nocturnalsecurity.com</a>.</p>

  <p>See also our <a href="/terms">Terms</a> and <a href="/privacy">Site Privacy Policy</a>. This Messaging Policy governs SMS specifically.</p>
</body>
</html>
